  "scope_limits": [
    "Original actor_start attaches the passed frame-phase object separately from the player/target owner; native attach/stop/restart routines and newest-first traversal execute.",
    "Three-actor fixtures use owned empty primitives, typed target/root coordinates outside the trigger radius, SDK/CD initialization and explicit external audio services. Target geometry and physical audio/rendering are unaccepted.",
